    "detailed_description": "<u>&quot;Card Age&quot;</u> is a casual, idle game that simulates management from the perspective of God<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game introduction</h2>Survive and develop in an exquisite world composed of a variety of cards, gradually unlock new technologies, build industrial assembly lines and face various interesting challenges, and build your own card era.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main content of the game</h2>\u25cf Purchase card packs in the element store<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/544ffbdb3025f914f594f31eca15d22e.poster.avif?t=1697558545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/544ffbdb3025f914f594f31eca15d22e.webm?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/544ffbdb3025f914f594f31eca15d22e.mp4?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25cf Open card pack<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/88f982526fb59a4b4e077fa045caf567.poster.avif?t=1697558545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/88f982526fb59a4b4e077fa045caf567.webm?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/88f982526fb59a4b4e077fa045caf567.mp4?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25cf Use residents to process and synthesize materials<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/2738e8ffca7328e36c018eb12db9ab81.poster.avif?t=1697558545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/2738e8ffca7328e36c018eb12db9ab81.webm?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/2738e8ffca7328e36c018eb12db9ab81.mp4?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25cf Construct buildings with different functions<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/6def75275e1b872d4a566ae4065086e4.poster.avif?t=1697558545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/6def75275e1b872d4a566ae4065086e4.webm?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/6def75275e1b872d4a566ae4065086e4.mp4?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25cf The battle between residents and enemies<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/2f8281313e35a089ccd83e067e199666.poster.avif?t=1697558545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/2f8281313e35a089ccd83e067e199666.webm?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381950/extras/2f8281313e35a089ccd83e067e199666.mp4?t=1697558545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25cf Complete era tasks and conduct era deduction<br><br>Game duration: It takes about 8-10 hours to complete the classic mode for the first time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>\u25cf Novice teaching mode, classic mode, free mode, challenge mode for selection<br>\u25cf Auto archive<br>\u25cf Residents get food automatically every month, no waiting time<br>\u25cf Each resident has an independent attribute. Gaining experience points and improving related attributes during work and battle will determine the different occupations of the resident<br>\u25cf Unique warehousing and logistics system, easy to organize your card world<br>\u25cf Support Steam Workshop<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other</h2>\u25cf Save frequently to prevent loss of game progress<br><br>We are committed to improving players\u2019 gaming experience. If you encounter any problems during the game or have any suggestions, please leave feedback in the discussion area. Thanks!",
